{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"熟悉的亲近让他觉得生活近在眼前，身体先绷紧，才察觉现实没变；他懊恼怎么又沉进去，忘了还有事要面对。\",\n      \"key\": \"现实没变\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他当初不肯再等，是怕珍惜的东西继续受损，光在心里想着那种生活也护不住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯再等\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新投入，却已不能毫无顾忌，怕自己又只顾硬撑，把刚找回的温柔磨掉，连想留住的生活也顾不上。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他原以为想清为何不能再等就能安心，如今还得想怎样争取才不伤温柔，理由更多了，还是定不下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"理由更多\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\", \"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并补回\",\n      \"why\": \"保留熟悉的亲近让他觉得向往的生活近在眼前、身体先于意识受惊的转向，并补回他察觉现实没变后懊恼自己又沉进去、忘了还有事要面对的自问。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把不能只靠怀念的现实理由接到当初不肯再等、怕珍惜之物继续受损的具体想法上，不再先讲道理再补记忆。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\", \"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想重新投入却怕硬撑耗尽温柔的冲突，删去重复的两难概括。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留理由增加却仍无法安定的变化，具体落到他如今还要顾虑怎样争取才不伤温柔。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"调整跨段箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"移除指向 S01-2 的弱联系，改由 S02-3 中珍惜之物已不能像从前那样自然拥有的经历，说明他为何怕它们继续受损。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"这是对音乐材料身份的另一种听法，与主体验不必同时成立，不需要转化为人物的心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "96a80d91-4e0c-45ba-aa60-aecafe97484c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T172525534570Z", "elapsed_seconds": 383.0, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:31:48.545741+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a09540df39d22724b6848b0eba5c960e08dcae74c29018075a430ea44d43aa3f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T172525534570Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "0dcad1dd62f2ab0492a6a6366612c82ff0c1bb923